oman-donated-nearly-100-acres-of-her-virginia-farm-and-money-for-an-amphitheatre-the-land-became-americas-only-national-park-dedicated-to-the-performing-arts/articleshow/133347082.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/in-1966-a-71-year-old-woman-donated-nearly-100-acres-of-her-virginia-farm-and-money-for-an-amphitheatre-the-land-became-americas-only-national-park-dedicated-to-the-performing-arts/articleshow/133347082.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-19T21:03:29+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133347174,imgsize-1082702.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Man and his dog uncover a 3,400-year-old Bronze Age axe in England]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133350566.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[In an English forest, a fortunate man and his dog uncovered an astonishing 3,400-year-old axe head emblematic of Britain's Bronze Age. This remarkable find sheds light on the enduring mysteries of our ancient past, revealing the metalworking capabilities of prehistoric communities. Artifacts like this one remind us that hidden treasures await discovery in even the most familiar settings.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/man-walking-his-dog-discovers-a-3400-year-old-bronze-age-axe-in-an-english-forest/articleshow/133350566.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/man-walking-his-dog-discovers-a-3400-year-old-bronze-age-axe-in-an-english-forest/articleshow/133350566.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-19T23:20:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133350717,imgsize-266454.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[82-year-old Tony Fahey builds ‘walking on water’ machine for charity record]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133350957.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[At 82, Tony Fahey embarks on a daring 24-hour world record attempt on water using a unique human-powered vessel named the aqua elliptica. This remarkable challenge seeks to generate funds for Make-A-Wish UK, reflecting his commitment to supporting children with serious health conditions. Following a serious accident years ago, Fahey returns to the water to showcase his remarkable endurance and innovative spirit.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/82-year-old-tony-fahey-built-a-walking-on-water-machine-for-a-24-hour-world-record-attempt-to-raise-money-for-charity/articleshow/133350957.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/82-year-old-tony-fahey-built-a-walking-on-water-machine-for-a-24-hour-world-record-attempt-to-raise-money-for-charity/articleshow/133350957.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-20T02:30:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133351036,imgsize-1820139.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Indian-origin couple die of major impact trauma in light plane crash in UK]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133352158.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/uk-couple-die-of-major-impact-trauma-after-light-plane-crashes-in-remote-wales-area/articleshow/133352158.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/uk-couple-die-of-major-impact-trauma-after-light-plane-crashes-in-remote-wales-area/articleshow/133352158.cms]